One dead in glider accident at Essen/Mülheim airport
There was a fatal accident at Mülheim/Essen Airport.
In a parking lot at Mülheim/Essen airport, a glider crashed on Sunday.
The pilot died in the accident.
There was a fatal accident near Mülheim/Essen airport on Sunday.
As the "Westdeutsche Allgemeine Zeitung" reports, a glider had crashed in the exhibition car park at the airport.
The pilot died.
As the "WAZ" further reports, the flight student was alone on board - the plane is said to be a single-seater.
The plane had already been approached at the time of the accident.
The crash site is located only near a marquee on the airport grounds.
