He wrote me beautiful letters, they were great letters.
Her personal connection has also borne political fruit: Trump referred to the halt of all nuclear and missile tests announced by Kim, even if critics so far see little more than lip service behind it.
The US president seemed quite aware that the affection for the "Rocket Man" - according to Trump's nickname for Kim - which is infamous for his martial threatening gestures.
